{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioSettingsOverview",
  "$description": "Project Settings › Overview: the project's identity. Its name, the description meta a search result reads, the production URL a sitemap is built from, its favicon, and the way through to Project Styles. Every row is a `jx-field` and every text control a `jx-textfield`, so the label, the sentence under it, the naming of the control and the announced refusal are all the kit's — this document draws the section's own rhythm and the favicon row, and nothing else. The adapter decides what is written and what is refused; nothing here reads `project.json`.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "overview"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What is NOT in this block is the conversion. Four stylesheet rules had no counterpart to write: `.settings-field-label` and `.settings-field-desc` drew a row's label and the sentence under it, and `jx-field` draws both — with the label actually NAMING the control, which the bare `<label>` they styled never did; `.settings-field-error` drew a refused value's sentence, and `jx-textfield` draws that into a permanent live region under the field, so the first refusal is announced rather than only a later one; and `.settings-site-description`'s `min-height` sized a textarea the kit already gives three rows. What is left is what this section decides for itself.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "gap": "20px",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"heading\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& jx-textfield": {
      "$description": "How wide a text control may grow. A name field spanning a 900px pane is a line the eye has to travel to read six characters; 420px is the measure `.settings-site-name`, `.settings-site-url` and `.settings-site-description` shared, and it is the one thing those three rules said that the kit does not.",
      "width": "100%",
      "maxWidth": "420px"
    },
    "& [part=\"favicon-row\"], & [part=\"styles-row\"]": {
      "$description": "The two rows whose control is not a single field, and the reason each opens with a plain `div`: `jx-field` names the first thing slotted into it, and a button named by its row would be announced as \"Favicon\" or \"Global Styles\" instead of the verb it carries. A `div` observes no naming, so the row leaves it alone and the buttons keep the names they say on screen.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"favicon\"], & [part=\"favicon-empty\"]": {
      "$description": "One box, whether or not there is an icon in it, so the row does not resize the moment an upload lands.",
      "width": "32px",
      "height": "32px",
      "boxSizing": "border-box",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)"
    },
    "& [part=\"favicon\"]": {
      "objectFit": "contain",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "padding": "2px"
    },
    "& [part=\"favicon-empty\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "border": "1px dashed var(--border)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"favicon-path\"]": {
      "$description": "Where the icon came from. It read `--spectrum-font-size-50` with an 11px fallback, which resolved only inside `<sp-theme>` — this document is mounted in the settings pane, where that name is not in scope and every one of these would have taken the fallback — so the size is the kit's scale and the colour is the studio layer's.",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "wordBreak": "break-all"
    },
    "& [part=\"section-error\"], & [part=\"favicon-error\"]": {
      "$description": "A failed write with no control of its own to sit under. Settings save on change, so a rejection nobody shows reads as \"my edit just vanished\"; the sentence stands, in the danger colour, until a later write succeeds.",
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "heading"
      },
      "textContent": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "section-error-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/hasSectionError"
      },
      "cases": {
        "true": {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section-error",
            "role": "alert"
          },
          "textContent": "${state.sectionError}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-field",
      "$props": {
        "span": true,
        "label": "Site Name",
        "description": "What this site is called — used in page titles and the project list.",
        "invalid": {
          "$ref": "#/state/nameInvalid"
        }
      },
      "attributes": {
        "part": "row",
        "data-field": "name"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "placeholder": "My Site",
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/nameValue"
            },
            "invalid": {
              "$ref": "#/state/nameInvalid"
            },
            "error": {
              "$ref": "#/state/nameError"
            }
          },
          "onchange": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/setName"
                },
                "value": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-field",
      "$props": {
        "span": true,
        "label": "Description",
        "description": "One or two sentences about the site. Search engines and link previews show this.",
        "invalid": {
          "$ref": "#/state/descriptionInvalid"
        }
      },
      "attributes": {
        "part": "row",
        "data-field": "description"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "multiline": true,
            "placeholder": "A short description of the site",
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/descriptionValue"
            },
            "invalid": {
              "$ref": "#/state/descriptionInvalid"
            },
            "error": {
              "$ref": "#/state/descriptionError"
            }
          },
          "onchange": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/setDescription"
                },
                "value": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-field",
      "$props": {
        "span": true,
        "label": "Production URL",
        "description": "Where the published site lives. Sitemaps and absolute links are built from it.",
        "invalid": {
          "$ref": "#/state/urlInvalid"
        }
      },
      "attributes": {
        "part": "row",
        "data-field": "url"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
          "$props": {
            "size": "sm",
            "type": "url",
            "placeholder": "https://example.com",
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/state/urlValue"
            },
            "invalid": {
              "$ref": "#/state/urlInvalid"
            },
            "error": {
              "$ref": "#/state/urlError"
            }
          },
          "onchange": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "operator": "call",
                "target": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/setUrl"
                },
                "value": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-field",
      "$props": {
        "span": true,
        "label": "Favicon",
        "description": "Upload an image to use as the site favicon."
      },
      "attributes": {
        "part": "row",
        "data-field": "favicon"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "favicon-row"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "favicon-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasFavicon"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "img",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "favicon",
                    "src": "${state.favicon}",
                    "alt": "Current favicon"
                  }
                },
                "false": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "favicon-empty",
                    "aria-hidden": "true"
                  },
                  "textContent": "—"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-button",
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm"
              },
              "attributes": {
                "part": "favicon-upload"
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/uploadFavicon"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "Upload Favicon"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "favicon-path-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasFavicon"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "favicon-path"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.favicon}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "favicon-error-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/hasFaviconError"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "favicon-error",
                "role": "alert"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.faviconError}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "jx-field",
      "$props": {
        "span": true,
        "label": "Global Styles",
        "description": "Design tokens and the default element styles that apply across every page. Opens Project Styles over this same document."
      },
      "attributes": {
        "part": "row",
        "data-field": "styles"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "styles-row"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-button",
              "$props": {
                "size": "sm",
                "disabled": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/stylesDisabled"
                }
              },
              "attributes": {
                "part": "styles-open",
                "title": "${state.stylesTitle}"
              },
              "onclick": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/openStyles"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "textContent": "Edit Global Styles"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
